uot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:360}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;About the Role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt; &lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW141388287 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW141388287 BCX0&quot;&gt;As an IT System Administrator, you will keep Dragos&#39;s systems, networks, and end-user environments secure, available, and&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW141388287 BCX0&quot;&gt;well-documented&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW141388287 BCX0&quot;&gt;. You will work directly with&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW141388287 BCX0&quot;&gt; The &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW141388287 BCX0&quot;&gt;IT team to maintain infrastructure, support employees, and improve how IT operates. The role is hybrid. You will work on-site in Maryland a few days each week and remotely the rest.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP Selected SCXW141388287 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:100}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
